# ==============================================================================
# RenalWatch Real Carrier SMS OTP Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# RenalWatch supports 3 carrier SMS gateways out of the box.
# Choose ONE of the providers below and add your API key.

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 1: Fast2SMS (Recommended & Easiest for Indian Numbers +91)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Sign up for a free account at https://www.fast2sms.com
# 2. Go to Dev API section and copy your API Authorization Key
# 3. Paste it here:
FAST2SMS_API_KEY=your_fast2sms_api_key_here

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 2: 2Factor.in (Specialized Indian Transactional OTP Route)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Sign up at https://2factor.in
# 2. Copy your API Key and paste it here:
# TWO_FACTOR_API_KEY=your_2factor_api_key_here

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPTION 3: Twilio (Global SMS Delivery)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Sign up at https://www.twilio.com
# 2. Copy your Account SID, Auth Token, and Virtual Phone Number:
# TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=your_twilio_account_sid
# TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=your_twilio_auth_token
# TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=+1234567890

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Clinic Management Passcode (Optional override)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CLINIC_ACCESS_KEY=1234
